      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "EXPERIMENTAL \u2014 no changes to product workflows.\nBase model, 30 steps, RES multistep, Simple. No Turbo.\nThe guide is fixed conditioning. The sampler gets a NEW empty AV latent.\nCanvas comes from the state. Keep VAE identifiers consistent.\nOptional pictures/audio can be connected to Ref2VA. Number only references actually supplied; the latent guide is not a <Picture 1> token.\nDefault TRUE loads a saved keyframe state without encoding pixels.\nTo bootstrap: select FALSE, upload a 32-aligned image, then copy the saved keyframe state path into the loader and switch TRUE.\nFor a generated H3 still: connect its sampler output to State from Latent, set origin=sampled and switch FALSE. Never use a sliced video token as a still.\nSave Take produces the root clip and state needed by the continuation test."
      ]
    }
